"background:#FFBBBB\">Description\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\"><i>This necklace is infused with a powerful, benevolent energy that is able to absorb and disperse energy drain and negative energy attacks such as those from the spells Enervation and Harm.</i>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"bg-color-1\" style=\"background:#FFBBBB\">Tips\n</th>\n<td class=\"bg-color-2\" style=\"background:#FFE4E1\">\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p>\n<ul><li><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: #FF0000;\"><span style=\"font-size: larger; font-weight: inherit;\"><i>This item cannot be fed to <a href=\"/page/Sentient_Weapon\" title=\"Sentient Weapon\">sentient jewels</a>.</i></span></span>\n<ul><li>IMPORTANT: Don't equip this item before you give it to your friend. This is bind on equip and cannot be traded after being equipped by someone.</li></ul></li></ul>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260817204154\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.070 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.129 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3197/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 20567/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 5052/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 32/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/200\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2019/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 13/150\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n119.37%  135.849     40 Template:IO\n100.00%  113.806      1 Template:Named_item\n100.00%  113.806      1 -total\n 96.54%  109.873      1 Template:Named_Jewelry\n 41.44%   47.163      2 Template:Lamannia_picture\n 40.01%   45.530      2 Template:IsLamannia\n 38.53%   43.851      2 Template:IsSpeculation\n 37.57%   42.753      2 Template:InCategory\n 17.83%   20.291      1 Template:Mat\n 17.10%   19.462      3 Template:Popup\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key ddowiki:pcache:idhash:48326-0!canonic